[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0361","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0361.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0742","title":"Debian Mailman 弱认证漏洞","description":"Debian 系统中的 Mailman 邮件列表管理软件存在弱认证机制漏洞。攻击者可以利用该漏洞绕过身份验证，获取系统管理权限，进而访问、修改邮件列表配置信息或窃取敏感数据。该漏洞影响 Debian 系统上运行的 Mailman 软件包。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0742"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-06-22T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Debian Mailman 软件包至已修复版本，或应用厂商提供的安全补丁。建议启用强密码认证机制，限制管理接口的访问来源 IP，并定期审计邮件列表管理员账户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T02:02:58Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/480"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0361.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1009","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0874","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 HTR/IDC/STM 文件请求缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 在处理 .HTR、.IDC 和 .STM 文件请求时，其过滤器 DLL 存在未检查的缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可发送特制畸形请求触发溢出，导致 IIS 服务崩溃造成拒绝服务，在精心构造下还可实现远程任意代码执行。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0874"],"sources":["cve","ms"],"published":"1999-06-16T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-019 提供的补丁，或通过 IIS 管理控制台移除不需要的 .HTR、.IDC、.STM 脚本映射以缓解风险。受影响版本为 IIS 4.0。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T19:36:28Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-019","http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ234905","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/j-048.shtml","http://www.eeye.com/html/Research/Advisories/AD06081999.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A915"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1009.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1009.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0729","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0729.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0929","title":"Novell NetWare HTTP Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Novell NetWare 操作系统中集成的 Novell-HTTP-Server 及第三方 YAWN Web 服务器存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过向服务器发送大量 HTTP GET 请求，耗尽服务器连接池与处理资源，导致服务器无法响应合法用户请求，造成服务中断。该漏洞利用方式简单，攻击门槛极低，属于典型的资源耗尽型 DoS 攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0929"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-06-16T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Novell NetWare 至厂商修复版本或安装最新补丁。对于已停止维护的旧版本，建议在网络边界部署反向代理或 Web 应用防火墙（WAF），配置请求速率限制（rate limiting）和连接数阈值，限制单个 IP 的并发连接数及每秒请求数，以缓解大量 HTTP GET 请求导致的资源耗尽攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0929","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0929"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0729.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0729.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0729.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0520","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0520.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0730","title":"G. Wilford man 符号链接攻击本地文件覆盖漏洞","description":"Debian man-db 软件包中的 zsoelim 程序存在符号链接（symlink）攻击漏洞。zsoelim 在处理文件时未正确验证文件路径，本地攻击者可创建一个指向目标系统敏感文件的符号链接，当 zsoelim 跟随该符号链接处理文件时，将导致目标文件被覆盖，从而造成任意文件写入。攻击条件为本地低权限用户即可触发，无需远程访问。该漏洞影响 Debian man-db 2.3.10 等早期版本，CVSS v2 评分 10.0，危害等级为高危，可能导致权限提升或系统文件被破坏。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0730"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-06-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:56Z","remediation":"升级 man-db 软件包至当前稳定版本（2.9.x 或更高），该漏洞存在于 zsoelim 的符号链接处理逻辑中，新版已修复此问题。执行 apt update && apt upgrade man-db 完成更新。作为临时缓解措施，可移除 zsoelim 的 setuid/setgid 位（chmod u-s,g-s /usr/bin/zsoelim），并避免在受信目录以外使用 man 工具，同时在 /tmp 等临时目录挂载时启用 noexec 和限制符号链接创建。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0730","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19243","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0f25967d744704fe14324ac10f2b57e945aed081/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0730.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0730","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0730.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2eb55660fa7a900eec90103b031be5d6f98d9ec/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0730.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1dbd44058e428445290bfb1f6fc6ecc0addbfd35/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9cm4-vwcc-jvg8/GHSA-9cm4-vwcc-jvg8.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0730.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/1999/19990612.data","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/mega-foss/blob/4829eeb7b0101570abbc87d2a697f2c0c2f4e5c3/src/cve/graphql/trial.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0520.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0520.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0520.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0307","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0307.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0713","title":"Compaq Tru64 UNIX dtlogin 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Compaq Tru64 UNIX 系统中的 dtlogin 程序存在权限提升漏洞。该程序在处理用户认证时未能正确验证权限，导致本地攻击者可通过向 dtlogin 发送特制请求或利用其不安全的文件权限，获取 root 权限。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，成功利用后可完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响 Compaq Tru64 UNIX 多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0713"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1999-06-11T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"Compaq Tru64 UNIX 已停止支持，建议迁移至受支持操作系统。如无法迁移，可移除 dtlogin 程序的 setuid root 权限位（chmod u-s /usr/dt/bin/dtlogin），并限制可登录控制台的用户组，仅允许受信任管理员使用本地控制台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/j-044.shtml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0307.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0875","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0875.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1023","title":"Oracle Solaris useradd 账户过期日期校验绕过漏洞","description":"Solaris 7.0 的 useradd 命令在处理 \"-e\" 参数指定的账户过期日期时，未能正确解析特定日期格式，导致账户过期后仍允许用户登录。该漏洞影响 Solaris 7.0 系统，攻击者需拥有有效账户且账户已过期，通过设置特定日期格式绕过过期限制继续登录系统，CVSS 评分 4.6，属于中等严重程度的权限绕过漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1023"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-06-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:32Z","remediation":"升级 Solaris 至 7.0 补丁 106327-01 或更高版本（Solaris 7 推荐补丁簇），或升级至 Solaris 8 及以上版本。若无法立即升级，可编辑 /etc/default/useradd 设置 INACTIVE=0 禁用账户过期功能，或通过 /etc/shadow 手动锁定过期账户（passwd -l 用户名）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92904175406756&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/426","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/df06113bb625f86b49f1950d55874a29f8e76a55/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1023.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1023","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-1023.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5297adfba5e91ee22e711c26c523b292d427c0d0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1023.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/solaris7_110869.nasl","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/solaris26_110883.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1023.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5805d482-63b1-4dfb-8afc-b26b682a9546.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0875.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0706","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0706.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0775","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9133,\"outputTokens\":23,\"totalTokens\":10820}}","description":"运行 IOS 的思科千兆交换机和路由器在访问控制列表（ACL）中对 \"established\" 关键字存在不当处理，导致网络访问控制机制被绕过。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 TCP 数据包，利用该漏洞让设备转发原本被 ACL 规则拒绝的未经授权数据包，从而绕过防火墙或路由器的访问控制策略。该漏洞影响运行 IOS 的思科千兆交换机及路由器系列产品，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0775"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-06-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:01Z","remediation":"升级受影响的 Cisco 千兆交换机/路由器至修复了该 ACL \"established\" 关键字处理缺陷的 IOS 版本（如 11.2(15)GS 及以上、12.0 系列对应修复版本），通过思科 Software Center 下载并安装官方 IOS 镜像；在无法立即升级时，临时修改访问控制列表，移除或重寫存在缺陷的 \"established\" 规则，改用基于状态的 CBAC 防火墙检查，并在边界过滤非法入站 TCP 数据包作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0775","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8981d7e7baa3f6c5d7a90cd823433b0422b8fcd2/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0775.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0775","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0775.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4cacb08131e7c4736ad136de17873dbcaeddf850/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0775.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/958f1672375e115879b3a6bd13e3638812260c7d/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vjxr-fvc6-86qw/GHSA-vjxr-fvc6-86qw.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0775.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000670.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87022/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0706.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1015","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1231","title":"OpenSSH 用户枚举漏洞","description":"SSH 2.0.12 及部分其他版本存在用户名枚举漏洞。当攻击者尝试登录时，服务器对有效用户名会多次提示输入密码，而对无效用户名仅提示一次即拒绝连接。远程攻击者可利用这一行为差异，通过枚举方式探测目标服务器上存在的合法用户账号，为后续暴力破解或针对性攻击提供前提条件。该漏洞影响 SSH 2.0.12 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1231"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-06-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:59Z","remediation":"升级到 SSH 2.1 及以上版本，或迁移至 OpenSSH（2.5+），这些版本统一了有效/无效用户名的密码提示行为，避免泄露用户存在性。如无法升级，可在 sshd_config 中设置 MaxAuthTries 为较小值并启用 LoginGraceTime 限制，同时配合 fail2ban 等工具监控暴力破解尝试。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/14758","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2276","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50269681ee58c9b5bf7169b73546eef94697389c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1231.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1231","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1231.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1231.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7g97-5hq7-x7mm/GHSA-7g97-5hq7-x7mm.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87557/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/1999.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0457d271-b4c6-4bb2-813d-1cf71d06fee5.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000668.txt","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8c2e4bec18ae978cff0216ba99e60936ec0d2cb7/1999/CVE-1999-1231.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1015.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1134","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1134.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1496","title":"Sudo 文件存在性信息泄露漏洞","description":"Sudo 1.5 存在信息泄露漏洞，本地用户通过尝试将目标文件名作为程序执行，系统在文件不存在时返回不同的错误提示，从而可探测任意文件是否存在。该漏洞影响 Debian Linux 2.1 和 Red Hat 6.0 等早期 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1496"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-06-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:33Z","remediation":"升级 Sudo 至 1.5.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了因不同错误信息而泄露文件存在性的问题。对于 Debian 2.1 或 Red Hat 6.0 等已停止维护的系统，建议整体升级至受支持的现代 Linux 发行版，确保 Sudo 版本不低于 1.8，以根除该信息泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/14665","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/321","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2277","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b172e0393d29bddb2ceeda5ce57e29123589a55b/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1496.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1496","https://github.com/trifectatechfoundation/sudo-rs/blob/e5a01fd7a20a5bfe5da6bc1b5cf7628e721c35c8/docs/sudo-cve.md","https://github.com/TH3xACE/SUDO_KILLER/blob/27ccd0e2d39528f9383864d5e3fe87f7bd2f60d3/CVE/cve.sudover.vuln.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1496.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9a5386d000a40888283d918a46b8928ffcbfca7b/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1496.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/321/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1496.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153500_153600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5