le":"Apple Mac OS X 1.0 Apache HTTP Server HTTP GET请求拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apple Mac OS X 1.0 系统中集成的 Apache HTTP Server 存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 CGI 程序发送大量 HTTP GET 请求，导致服务器生成大量进程从而耗尽系统资源，最终造成 Apache 服务崩溃。该漏洞影响 Mac OS X 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。目前官方已停止支持该版本，建议升级至更高版本系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1412"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-06-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:23Z","remediation":"升级 Apple Mac OS X 至 10.1 及以上版本，或升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 1.3.20 及以上版本。配置 Apache 的 `MaxClients`、`MaxRequestsPerChild` 等指令限制并发 CGI 进程数，防止资源耗尽；建议在反向代理或防火墙层实施速率限制（rate limiting）作为额外缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/14215","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/306","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19244","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/1999/CVE-1999-1412.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/51c6246292cd60528ab00cc0df9c1fcdee341e7e/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1412.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1412","https://github.com/Indie365/cbl-mariner/blob/80d864c0a617439675510c037c8a4589aa596fbb/SPECS/httpd/CVE-1999-1412.nopatch","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6c772403a169ecbfd38454bff1a2ab85bf6a7d51/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1412.json","https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/021f7dd41540fe6c5cf50feee2590afcad0a4570/upstream-layers/meta-openembedded/meta-webserver/recipes-httpd/apache2/apache2_2.4.68.bb","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1412.md","https://github.com/ericpattison/Mariner/blob/6b6b870716931ff24c71b575ecd690aa7979fdd6/CBL-Mariner/SPECS/httpd/CVE-1999-1412.nopatch","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/c6cfbc6dcd2736534847aa2867e9391d3a11f2b2/data/1999/CVE-1999-1412.json","https://github.com/openembedded/meta-openembedded/blob/01232d6238c4e73761fcf7a49682bdc5caa60e44/meta-webserver/recipes-httpd/apache2/apache2_2.4.68.bb"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1101.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1101.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1101.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1098","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1098.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1400","title":"The Economist 1999 屏幕保护程序 安全绕过漏洞","description":"The Economist 1999 屏幕保护程序在启用\"密码保护\"选项后存在安全绕过漏洞。具有物理访问权限的攻击者可在屏幕锁定状态下通过运行 Internet Explorer 绕过屏幕保护程序，从而读取受保护文件。该漏洞影响 The Economist 1999 屏幕保护程序版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。攻击者需具备物理接触目标系统的条件方可利用。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1400"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-06-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:21Z","remediation":"该屏保为 1999 年发布的已停止维护软件，官方不再提供补丁。建议立即卸载该屏保程序，改用操作系统自带的锁屏功能（Windows 按 Win+L 键锁定工作站），并设置屏幕保护为 \"无\" 或使用 Windows 登录密码保护。同时启用组策略 \"不显示最后的登录用户名\" 和 \"登录时间过期后锁定会话\" 作为增强措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.indenial.com/hypermail/ntbugtraq/1999/June1999/0007.html","http://archives.indenial.com/hypermail/ntbugtraq/1999/June1999/0009.html","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=92851653600852&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/466","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/41de94138b7cf6e858138ec4e79e16fbec611fa4/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1400.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1400","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1400.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/175fba1f481a7f7cf5bdb5344d3c0e47af1884ef/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1400.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa37ed0317ce1265b487f92916077b9ccbfe3349/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7cw7-fpf7-gx4h/GHSA-7cw7-fpf7-gx4h.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6d096c97-530f-4bd4-aa6f-5cf867018e78.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_bypass.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1098.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1688","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1688.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1063","title":"CDomainFree whois_raw.cgi 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"CDomain Web 服务器中 whois_raw.cgi CGI 脚本存在命令注入漏洞，由于程序未对用户提交的 fqdn 参数中特殊字符进行过滤，远程攻击者可通过向该脚本发送包含 shell 元字符的恶意请求，实现在目标服务器上以 Web 服务器权限执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 CdomainFree 2.4 及之前版本，攻击无需认证，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1063"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-06-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:37Z","remediation":"建议立即从服务器移除或禁用 whois_raw.cgi 脚本，或升级到 CdomainFree 最新版本。如无法升级，应对 fqdn 参数做严格输入过滤，禁止 shell 元字符（; ` | & $）传入，同时考虑迁移到替代的 Whois 查询方案。若该 CGI 非业务必需，直接删除或注释相关配置即可彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/14019","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/304","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2251","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19242","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7481e97cf7b60